{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/inverted.png?t=1744940274\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tarot card themed rogue-lite action game testing your reflex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock playable Major Arcana with unique skills and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic rogue-lite gameplay by combining different Minor Arcana.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Extra</i> rogue-lite gameplay with stage adjustments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging levels and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Appreciate the beautiful original Rider-Waite public domain artwork.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your mouse and control your fate to survive the Star, Moon, Sun and Judgement and flip the World back to normal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/pentacle.png?t=1744940274\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/cups.png?t=1744940274\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/wand.png?t=1744940274\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/extras/sword.png?t=1744940274\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665270?t=1744940274","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665270?t=1744940274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665270/4d24db069ced169923cc45cd8c7ec5efbb43064f/capsule_